32:{"altText":"","srcSet":null,"sourceUrl":"/__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/10/Jamie-oliver.svg","mediaDetails":"$33"}
30:{"text":"We have worked with Kota on three Jamie Oliver books. 5 Ingredients, Jamie Cooks Italy and now the very exciting VEG campaign. They have brought each book to life for digital advertising and out of home in really creative and innovative ways. It’s also a joy to work with such a dedicated and sound team, can’t wait to work with them again.","backgroundColor":"#e7b6d7","name":"Jamie Oliver","speciality":null,"button":"$31","logo":"$32"}
